## 5. the two seed t-parts as generated from the relators (SEEDGEN, X = t-part in M), p = 5, 7, 11, 13
p=5 SEEDGEN [a,b,a]{210} mu (2,1,0) f0: 4*baa 2*aba 4*aab  X= 1*E23t0^3.E13t0^2.
p=5 SEEDGEN [b,c,c]{012} mu (0,1,2) f0: 1*ccb 3*cbc 1*bcc  X= 4*E23t0^3.E21t1^2.
p=7 SEEDGEN [a,b,a]{210} mu (2,1,0) f0: 6*baa 2*aba 6*aab  X= 1*E23t0^5.E13t0^2.
p=7 SEEDGEN [b,c,c]{012} mu (0,1,2) f0: 1*ccb 5*cbc 1*bcc  X= 6*E23t0^5.E21t1^2.
p=11 SEEDGEN [a,b,a]{210} mu (2,1,0) f0: 10*baa 2*aba 10*aab  X= 1*E23t0^9.E13t0^2.
p=11 SEEDGEN [b,c,c]{012} mu (0,1,2) f0: 1*ccb 9*cbc 1*bcc  X= 10*E23t0^9.E21t1^2.
